  "javadoc_description": "Class for color coding groups of `Tree`s.\n\nAfter a mapping property and a color table (LUT) are specified, the mapping proceeds as follows: 1) Each Tree in the group is measured for the mapping property; 2) each measurement is mapped to a LUT entry that is used to color each Tree. Mapping limits can be optionally specified",
